     Function eellffttcc__ddeemmaannggllee() may fail with the following errors:

     [EINVAL]        Argument _e_n_c_o_d_e_d_n_a_m_e was not a valid encoded name.

     [ENAMETOOLONG]  The output buffer specified by arguments _b_u_f_f_e_r and
                     _b_u_f_s_i_z_e was too small to hold the decoded function proto‐
                     type.

